%% Coding-agent evaluation workflow — editable owner-review source
flowchart LR
    T[Task specification] --> B[Clean baseline]
    B --> E[Agent execution]
    E --> A[Run artifacts]
    A --> C[Deterministic checks]
    C --> H[Human / advisory assessment]
    H --> R[Comparative reporting]

    classDef controlled fill:#0d141e,stroke:#8b9bb0,color:#f1f5f9
    classDef captured fill:#0d2030,stroke:#22d3ee,color:#e8eef5
    classDef automated fill:#0b2b2b,stroke:#2dd4bf,color:#f1f5f9
    classDef assisted fill:#231f18,stroke:#f4d38a,color:#f1f5f9

    class T,B controlled
    class A captured
    class C automated
    class E,H,R assisted
